*Key Formulae:*
- *Divergence Theorem:*
  $ integral.double_S bold(F) dot d bold(S) = integral.triple_V (nabla dot bold(F)) d V $
- *Divergence:* $nabla dot bold(F) = (partial F_x) / (partial x) + (partial F_y) / (partial y) + (partial F_z) / (partial z)$
- *Spherical Coordinates integration element:*
  $ d V = rho^2 sin(phi) d rho d phi d theta $
